---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

export const prerender = true;
---

<Base
  title="Terms & Conditions | S N Bajaj And Co, Chartered Accountants Surat"
  description="Terms and Conditions governing the use of S N Bajaj And Co website and professional chartered accountancy advisory services in Surat, Gujarat."
  canonical="/terms-and-conditions"
>
  <Header />

  <article class="section" style="flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; padding: 130px 10% 80px; gap: 40px;">
    <!-- Breadcrumb & Header -->
    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding-bottom: 30px;">
      <div style="display: flex; gap: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: #718096; margin-bottom: 15px;">
        <a href="/" style="color: var(--primary-color);">Home</a>
        <span>/</span>
        <span>Terms and Conditions</span>
      </div>
      <span style="color: var(--primary-color); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 0.95rem; text-transform: uppercase;">
        User Agreement
      </span>
      <h1 style="font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 3rem); font-weight: 700; color: var(--secondary-color); margin-top: 8px;">
        Terms & Conditions
      </h1>
      <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #718096; margin-top: 8px;">
        Last Updated: October 2026 • Effective Date: January 1, 2025
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Intro Card -->
    <div style="background: #f7fafc; border-left: 4px solid var(--primary-color); padding: 24px; border-radius: 4px;">
      <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 28px; color: #2d3748; margin: 0;">
        These Terms and Conditions govern your access to and use of the website <strong>snbajaj.com</strong> and the associated client portals operated by <strong>S N Bajaj And Co. (Chartered Accountants)</strong>. By using this website or engaging our firm for accounting, tax, or advisory services, you accept and agree to these terms.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Content Sections -->
    <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 35px; color: #2d3748; font-size: 16px; line-height: 28px;">
      <section>
        <h2 style="font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--secondary-color); margin-bottom: 12px;">
          1. Professional Services & Advisory Nature
        </h2>
        <p>
          The informational content, blog posts, calculators, and compliance guides published on this website are provided for general educational guidance only. They do not constitute formal legal, financial, or tax opinions until and unless a formal professional engagement is executed between the client and S N Bajaj And Co.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 style="font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--secondary-color); margin-bottom: 12px;">
          2. Client Responsibilities & Data Integrity
        </h2>
        <p>
          When you engage S N Bajaj And Co. for tax filing (GST, Income Tax, TDS, ROC), you warrant that:
        </p>
        <ul style="list-style-type: disc; margin-left: 25px; margin-top: 10px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;">
          <li>All books of account, sales & purchase invoices, bank statements, and business turnover figures provided to us are true, authentic, and complete.</li>
          <li>All required documentation is supplied well prior to statutory filing deadlines (such as monthly GST dates or annual ITR due dates). Late document submission by the client may result in statutory penalties, for which our firm bears no liability.</li>
          <li>You will immediately notify our office of any notices, demands, or discrepancies received from the Income Tax Department or GST authorities.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 style="font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--secondary-color); margin-bottom: 12px;">
          3. Compliance with Indian Tax & Corporate Laws
        </h2>
        <p>
          All advisory and filing procedures are conducted in compliance with the prevailing laws of India, including the <em>Income Tax Act 1961</em>, <em>Central Goods and Services Tax Act 2017</em>, and <em>Companies Act 2013</em>. The firm adheres strictly to the regulatory guidelines and code of ethics established by the Institute of Chartered Accountants of India (ICAI).
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 style="font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--secondary-color); margin-bottom: 12px;">
          4. Professional Fees & Invoicing
        </h2>
        <p>
          Professional fees for audit, tax consultancy, company incorporation, and retainer services are billed as per mutually accepted engagement terms. Invoices are payable upon receipt. Government fees, stamp duties, GST challan amounts, and statutory portal charges are payable directly by the client.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 style="font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--secondary-color); margin-bottom: 12px;">
          5. Intellectual Property
        </h2>
        <p>
          All website designs, trademarks, text, graphics, and articles published on snbajaj.com are the intellectual property of S N Bajaj And Co. You may not reproduce, copy, distribute, or create derivative works from our materials without express written authorization.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 style="font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--secondary-color); margin-bottom: 12px;">
          6. Limitation of Liability
        </h2>
        <p>
          While we exercise due professional care in auditing, tax planning, and filing, S N Bajaj And Co. shall not be liable for:
        </p>
        <ul style="list-style-type: disc; margin-left: 25px; margin-top: 10px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;">
          <li>Errors resulting from fraudulent, inaccurate, or forged documents provided by the client.</li>
          <li>System downtime, network failure, or technical errors on government portals (e.g., GSTN portal, Income Tax e-filing portal, MCA portal).</li>
          <li>Indirect, special, or consequential damages arising from business decisions made based on general website content.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 style="font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--secondary-color); margin-bottom: 12px;">
          7. Governing Law and Jurisdiction
        </h2>
        <p>
          These Terms and Conditions and any disputes arising out of your relationship with S N Bajaj And Co. shall be governed by and interpreted under the laws of the Republic of India. The courts located in <strong>Surat, Gujarat, India</strong> shall have exclusive jurisdiction over all claims and proceedings.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 style="font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--secondary-color); margin-bottom: 12px;">
          8. Contact Information
        </h2>
        <div style="background: #edf2f7; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin-top: 10px;">
          <p><strong>S N Bajaj And Co.</strong> — Chartered Accountants</p>
          <p>2007, Trade House, Opp. Man Darwaja Fire Station, Ring Road, Surat - 395002, Gujarat, India</p>
          <p>Email: <a href="mailto:casnbajaj2015@gmail.com" style="color: var(--primary-color);">casnbajaj2015@gmail.com</a></p>
          <p>Phone: <a href="tel:+919909831995" style="color: var(--primary-color);">+91 99098 31995</a></p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>

  <Footer />
</Base>
